  "description": "Red field parted vertically, the hoist charged with a yellow six-petalled flower, the fly with the arms of the Duchy of Segorbe (the four bars, a castle, a lion and eagles).",
  "history": "The flag was approved by resolution of 25 September 2008 of the conseller de Presidència, published in the Diari Oficial de la Comunitat Valenciana; it is a flag of 2:3, red, parted per vertical half, with the arms of the Duchy of Segorbe at the fly as they appear in the municipal arms (approved 13 December 2006); the standard is similar but vertical.",
